# The output of tools/prof/run.py: one JSON record and one log for each pass of a run.
#
# Neither is tracked. The logs are large, and nothing in the repository reads a record: the
# record names the device, the event set and the thermal status of one run, thus it is the
# provenance of a number while that number is under discussion. A number that a decision
# rests on goes into the project record, not into this directory.
*.log
*.json
